# Trivy Ignore File
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Add CVE IDs or misconfiguration IDs here to suppress known
# false-positives or accepted risks.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-2023-XXXXX          ← suppress a specific CVE
#   AVD-DS-0002             ← suppress an IaC misconfiguration check
#
# Example:
#   CVE-2023-44487          ← HTTP/2 rapid reset (mitigated at LB level)
#   AVD-DS-0002             ← "root user" warning for build-only stages
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
